\BWardner\W on FPGA

  Toaplan TP-009 / Taito B25
          1987

Z80 main and sound CPUs, a
TMS320C10 co-processor, YM3812
and the Toaplan sprite unit.

The DSP is not protection: it
runs enemy fire, collisions and
sprite placement, writing them
into the main CPU's own RAM.

   Report issues to:
